# 7.20 DDR5继承与DDR6修改关系

**表7-3 维护类服务演进关系**

| DDR5设计内容 | DDR6处理 | 收敛后的变化 |
|---|---|---|
| PAS_RC Refresh结构 | KEEP/MODIFY | 继续作为普通Refresh Owner |
| tREFI Timer思想 | KEEP/MODIFY | 统一进入Timing Calendar/Deadline |
| Refresh Debt | KEEP/MODIFY | Refresh继续独立拥有 |
| REFsb相关Selection | REPLACE | 演进为REF_AB/REF_DIST |
| Refresh Coverage | MODIFY | 支持Distributed Selector/Coverage |
| Local tRFC Counter | MOVE | Timing统一管理 |
| Grant即Refresh Credit | DELETE | Registered-equivalent REF Event后Accounting |
| PAS_RFMC独立结构 | KEEP | RFM继续独立Owner |
| DDR5 RAA类Accounting | MODIFY | 演进为PRAC/BAT/PRFM |
| Refresh/RFM各自PRE | MERGE BACKEND | Shared PRE |
| PRE Target=Close Target | DELETE ASSUMPTION | 区分Command/Timing/Actual Close/Accounting集合 |
| ACT身份隐式关联 | MODIFY | 建立必要Activation Lifetime |
| 固定ACT Generation | CONDITIONAL | 仅Late Close/ABA风险存在时需要 |
| Refresh/RFM共用Accounting | PROHIBITED | Accounting继续完全独立 |
| 私有Maintenance Actual接口 | NOT USED | 由标准DFI Mapping形成内部Event |
| PHY异常汇总信号 | MODIFY | 保留标准`dfi_alert_n` |

